**4. Status to the operator (chat), then the poll**

> **Now:** T<n> "Quarterly rotation of the Pritunl console admin password, both sites" is in the backlog at `brainstorm` (stage 0: the design brainstorm by the two product advisors). Nothing is dispatched yet. The Codex CLI on this workstation has no superpowers skills (`~/.agents/skills` holds only `herdr`), so `prod-codex` cannot run `superpowers:brainstorming`. `prod-fable` has it. All four advisor tabs are idle. No live machine was touched and no votes were taken.
